; Explicit inverse rescaling for FLT/Three.lean:628-656.
; Omega coefficient identities cancel the witnessed inverse, preserve
; the last coefficient and reconstruct a lambda-powered cube.
; Both new coefficients have constructed unit inverses. Their formulas
; are u4=(omega*u3)*v and u5=-((omega^2*u1)*v), with v inverse to u2.
